{"title":"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rowan is given a square grid whose side length is an odd integer. The square is then divided into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> squares,. Rowan shades each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> square along the two diagonals and does not shade any of the remaining squares. For example, a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> grid is shown in which Rowan has shaded the squares along the diagonals.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part A\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part A</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_B\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part B\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part B</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_C\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part C\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part C</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_D\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part D\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part D</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC\" title=\"2012 CIMC\">2012 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6\">Part A Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p